#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:5
#: 32d5b1eb15be47f096ea3a4e916f332f
msgid "Using SITL with Webots C/C++"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 Webots C/C++ 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:11
#: 0a40dfe5234f4a8a8c45d1b2137d1ef7
msgid ""
"`Webots <https://cyberbotics.com/>`__ is a simulator mainly used for "
"robotics. It is easy to build many vehicles using it. ArduPilot has Rover, "
"Quadcopter, and Tricopters examples that have been built especially for this"
" simulator."
msgstr ""
"`Webots <https://cyberbotics.com/>`__ "
"是一款主要用于机器人领域的仿真器，使用它可以轻松构建多种飞行器。ArduPilot 提供了专门为该仿真器构建的 Rover、四旋翼和三旋翼示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:14
#: 7058f1e3cf324187a12133e09f0549b2
msgid ""
"You can download Webots simulator from `www.cyberbotics.com "
"<https://www.cyberbotics.com/#download/>`__. To run Webots just type webots "
"in command line."
msgstr ""
"您可以从 `www.cyberbotics.com <https://www.cyberbotics.com/#download/>`__ 下载 "
"Webots 仿真器。在命令行中输入 webots 即可运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:18
#: ee9402c1cbc64b7d9eff280450ddca28
msgid "Running the Examples"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:20
#: 49044d2ca406418cb6eecf963a8cd250
msgid "Open Webots using the command line."
msgstr "通过命令行打开 Webots。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:21
#: d4b6c4e108f34083b36cc481e73c057e
msgid ""
"Download and open a vehicle from the `vehicle examples folder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/worlds>`__"
"   such as  ``webots_quadPlus.wbt``."
msgstr ""
"从 `飞行器示例文件夹 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/worlds>`__"
" 下载并打开一个飞行器，例如 ``webots_quadPlus.wbt``。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:22
#: aeef823180164b56acbfa17453f4d64a
msgid ""
"Compile the Robot Controller and WorldInfo physics plugin using Webots GUI "
"by opening their respective source files (`ardupilot_SITL_QUAD.c "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/controllers/ardupilot_SITL_QUAD/ardupilot_SITL_QUAD.c>`__"
" and `sitl_physics_env.c "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/plugins/physics/sitl_physics_env/sitl_physics_env.c>`__)"
" and running ``Build > Build``. More info about building with Webots can be "
"found `here <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/webots-built-in-editor>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用 Webots GUI 打开各自的源文件（`ardupilot_SITL_QUAD.c "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/controllers/ardupilot_SITL_QUAD/ardupilot_SITL_QUAD.c>`__"
" 和 `sitl_physics_env.c "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots/plugins/physics/sitl_physics_env/sitl_physics_env.c>`__）并运行"
" ``Build > Build``，编译 Robot Controller 和 WorldInfo 物理插件。更多关于使用 Webots "
"构建的信息可在 `此处 <https://cyberbotics.com/doc/guide/webots-built-in-editor>`__ "
"找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:23
#: dcb2c19b18ca40f9809aba64c8428c68
msgid "Press Run on Webots GUI. Now the simulator is running."
msgstr "在 Webots GUI 中按 Run。现在仿真器正在运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:24
#: 66cc5494047d413a9178a6567720e005
msgid ""
"Run ArduPilot's SITL using available scripts in the `examples folder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用 `示例文件夹 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Webots>`__"
" 中的可用脚本运行 ArduPilot SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:35
#: c9db9b8db2c84f1fa5f5d2a224a48294
msgid ""
"It is important to run Webots before ArduPilot's SITL , otherwise the socket"
" connection may not establish."
msgstr "必须在 ArduPilot SITL 之前运行 Webots，否则套接字连接可能无法建立。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:37
#: c121e32e8aa947ebbf3a7d44a0b44489
msgid ""
"As of writing, these instructions work with Webots 2021b. Newer versions may"
" or may not work correctly."
msgstr "截至撰写本文时，这些说明适用于 Webots 2021b。较新版本可能正常工作，也可能不正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:40
#: 7ba078a0287649c8ab08f6e33df17449
msgid "Simulation Parameters"
msgstr "仿真参数"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:42
#: 6780d120027544fb8fa8324e169b9e77
msgid ""
"There are two types of parameters, the first type is passed to SITL and the "
"second is configured in Webots."
msgstr "有两类参数，第一类传递给 SITL，第二类在 Webots 中配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:44
#: 3d746cd01b9e470098e107ebab33002a
msgid ""
"SITL communicates with Webots using TCP sockets, so SITL should have the "
"same port number as Webots. Usually you don't need to change the default "
"port 5599, but when you run multiple robots you will need to use different "
"ports for each simulation instance."
msgstr ""
"SITL 使用 TCP 套接字与 Webots 通信，因此 SITL 应与 Webots 使用相同的端口号。通常不需要更改默认端口 "
"5599，但运行多个机器人时需要为每个仿真实例使用不同端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:49
#: 938e4c2ef73248609dbe46c20ed04cdc
msgid "Advantage of Webots"
msgstr "Webots 的优势"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:51
#: bed69d914acf4656b03f32058b6ae554
msgid "Controllers can be written in c, c++, python, and MatLab."
msgstr "控制器可以用 C、C++、Python 和 MATLAB 编写。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:52
#: 5e8a8e0c84274e3c9b9889fb8bd021d4
msgid "A lot of sensors exist."
msgstr "提供大量传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:53
#: 09b55ce79a4f48c0b943c06a2cbc4ac5
msgid "Ability to add custom physics to simulate things such as wind."
msgstr "可以添加自定义物理效果来仿真风等现象。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:54
#: 264c9a6366f14b3aa49c7ccb49fb8687
msgid ""
"Ability to add OpenStreetMap and run the simulator in environments very "
"similar to reality."
msgstr "可以添加 OpenStreetMap，在与现实非常相似的环境中运行仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:58
#: 4c48d600136d4990b7f24f8167539f98
msgid "How to Connect Your Own World with ArduPilot"
msgstr "如何将自定义世界与 ArduPilot 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:61
#: 40332611cc9043b6a6894b7708ede7fd
msgid "WorldInfo"
msgstr "WorldInfo"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:63
#: e13eb3c34edd4436989333d70b193b52
msgid "The following parameters are important to be set in WorldInfo"
msgstr "以下参数在 WorldInfo 中必须设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:65
#: f75458b765cf4389bbe0c2a12c9b6b26
msgid "Field *\"basicTimeStep\"* = 1 or 2"
msgstr "字段 *「basicTimeStep」* = 1 或 2"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:67
#: 989939bd1b4a4e198725992f3651cbd6
msgid ""
"Field *\"physics\"* is used to attach the physics plugin file "
"*\"sitl_physics_env\"*  which is used to simulate wind and drag in a very "
"simple way."
msgstr "字段 *「physics」* 用于附加物理插件文件 *「sitl_physics_env」*，该插件以简单方式仿真风和阻力。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:71
#: 24252702ff734c1e9a0e17d7303cce67
msgid "Vehicle Robot"
msgstr "飞行器机器人"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:72
#: e7f099e05f934a47b6c48f6c3cee67a6
msgid ""
"You can copy & paste the vehicle robot multiple times, each time you need "
"to:"
msgstr "您可以多次复制粘贴飞行器机器人，每次需要："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:74
#: f519b23bce5e40a88b816c6d37c54044
msgid "give the new robot a new name."
msgstr "为新机器人指定一个新名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:75
#: 858fa1b79ab247dc865693d7c70881b8
msgid ""
"Field *\"CustomData\"* should be equal to robot index number i.e. "
"1,2,3,...etc."
msgstr "字段 *「CustomData」* 应等于机器人的索引编号，即 1、2、3……等。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:76
#: bf5a1a6762f543d9847a616e449cf232
msgid "Field *\"controller\"* should is selected based on the vehicle used."
msgstr "字段 *「controller」* 应根据所用飞行器进行选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots-cpp.rst:77
#: 1442c639dcd24ee78252c39877f65772
msgid ""
"Field *\"controllerArgs\"* specifies many important factors, mainly the TCP "
"port which should be equal to SITL's TCP port that will connect to this "
"robot in the simulator."
msgstr ""
"字段 *「controllerArgs」* 指定许多重要因素，主要是 TCP 端口，该端口应与 SITL 中连接到该机器人的 TCP 端口相同。"
